  <body>
    <div>
      <p begin="00:00.613" end="00:02.113" ttm:agent="v1">[Intro]</p>
      <p begin="00:00.872" end="00:02.372" ttm:agent="v1">The world is yours-yours-yours</p>
      <p begin="00:01.943" end="00:03.443" ttm:agent="v1">[Chorus: 1nonly]</p>
      <p begin="00:02.475" end="00:04.370" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Push yo' shit back (Shit back), what a shame, what a waste (B***h)</p>
      <p begin="00:04.370" end="00:06.236" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Two twin Glocks, I ain't talkin' Mary Kate (Ayy, ayy)</p>
      <p begin="00:06.236" end="00:08.142" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Can't **** a dirty thot, she way too basic (Too basic)</p>
      <p begin="00:08.142" end="00:10.003" ttm:agent="v1">Oh, shit, I just made another K</p>
      <p begin="00:10.003" end="00:11.869" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Let's slow it down and now fast (Now fast)</p>
      <p begin="00:11.869" end="00:13.460" ttm:agent="v1">Still braggin' 'bout the b***h, no racks</p>
      <p begin="00:13.460" end="00:15.374" ttm:agent="v1">10K, my fit, why you all up in my bag?</p>
      <p begin="00:15.374" end="00:17.250" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">And I be getting to the cash, lil' b***h, and that's facts (Ayy, ayy, ayy)</p>
      <p begin="00:17.250" end="00:18.750" ttm:agent="v1">[Verse 1: Ciscaux]</p>
      <p begin="00:17.779" end="00:19.648" ttm:agent="v1">H-hey, I'm Ciscaux, nice to meet me</p>
      <p begin="00:19.648" end="00:21.505" ttm:agent="v1">Been had game since I played in Pee-Wee</p>
      <p begin="00:21.505" end="00:23.651" ttm:agent="v1">I'm known to pop out like this shit was 3D</p>
      <p begin="00:23.651" end="00:25.533" ttm:agent="v1">And the song's been all that they had on repeat, okay</p>
      <p begin="00:25.533" end="00:27.936" ttm:agent="v1">What's your name? What's your sign?</p>
      <p begin="00:27.936" end="00:29.436" ttm:agent="v1">Baby, what you claim?</p>
      <p begin="00:29.029" end="00:30.910" ttm:agent="v1">Want more 'bout me? Baby, I'm Bruce Wayne</p>
      <p begin="00:30.910" end="00:34.159" ttm:agent="v1">Got my first check, spent it all on a chain, thought it came with the fame</p>
      <p begin="00:34.159" end="00:35.659" ttm:agent="v1">I-I think it's time that the champagne popped</p>
      <p begin="00:35.517" end="00:37.398" ttm:agent="v1">You wanna ask where I been, b***h, I been on top</p>
      <p begin="00:37.398" end="00:39.256" ttm:agent="v1">I got a .40 in my pocket, I'ma let that pop</p>
      <p begin="00:39.256" end="00:41.671" ttm:agent="v1">I thought I told you, thought I told you that we won't stop, and like</p>
      <p begin="00:41.671" end="00:43.267" ttm:agent="v1">When we step in, all these b*****s flockin'</p>
      <p begin="00:43.267" end="00:45.153" ttm:agent="v1">Everybody wanna know 'bout what I got</p>
      <p begin="00:45.153" end="00:47.009" ttm:agent="v1">Got twin yachts, six shots, big deal, your loss</p>
      <p begin="00:47.009" end="00:49.180" ttm:agent="v1">No tap, just Voss, big boss, Rick Ross</p>
      <p begin="00:49.180" end="00:51.074" ttm:agent="v1">Yeah, push yo' shit—</p>
      <p begin="00:51.074" end="00:53.234" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Back (Shit back), what a shame, what a waste (B***h)</p>
      <p begin="00:53.234" end="00:54.850" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Two twin Glocks, I ain't talkin' Mary Kate (Ayy, ayy)</p>
      <p begin="00:54.850" end="00:56.765" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Can't **** a dirty thot, she way too basic (Too basic)</p>
      <p begin="00:56.765" end="00:58.903" ttm:agent="v1">Oh, shit, I just made another K</p>
      <p begin="00:58.903" end="01:00.527" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Let's slow it down and now fast (Now fast)</p>
      <p begin="01:00.527" end="01:02.388" ttm:agent="v1">Still braggin' 'bout the b***h, no racks</p>
      <p begin="01:02.388" end="01:04.289" ttm:agent="v1">10K, my fit, why you all up in my bag?</p>
      <p begin="01:04.289" end="01:06.179" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">And I be getting to the cash, lil' b***h, and that's facts (Ayy, ayy, ayy)</p>
      <p begin="01:06.179" end="01:07.679" ttm:agent="v1">[Verse 2: Wassup Rocker]</p>
      <p begin="01:06.448" end="01:08.594" ttm:agent="v1">Ayy, what a drag, what a waste, throw a bag in your face</p>
      <p begin="01:08.594" end="01:10.196" ttm:agent="v1">If he keep talkin' smack, catch a right to the face</p>
      <p begin="01:10.196" end="01:12.338" ttm:agent="v1">Had to jog to the block with my dickies pants on</p>
      <p begin="01:12.338" end="01:14.251" ttm:agent="v1">'Cause all of my pockets fat, too out of shape</p>
      <p begin="01:14.251" end="01:16.152" ttm:agent="v1">So where should I start? Iced out my jaws</p>
      <p begin="01:16.152" end="01:18.307" ttm:agent="v1">Standing ovations and rounds of applause</p>
      <p begin="01:18.307" end="01:20.208" ttm:agent="v1">I don't shop at the malls, we pissin' 'em off</p>
      <p begin="01:20.208" end="01:22.110" ttm:agent="v1">I raise bars like I just hit a bench press</p>
      <p begin="01:22.110" end="01:24.511" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Yo, I just got a DM from PinkPantheress)</p>
      <p begin="01:24.511" end="01:26.011" ttm:agent="v1">[Verse 3: Shady MOON, Shady MOON &amp; Ciscaux]</p>
      <p begin="01:24.780" end="01:26.405" ttm:agent="v1">Ayy, I won't wear a fit that cost a band or less</p>
      <p begin="01:26.405" end="01:28.282" ttm:agent="v1">Tried to b***h when we're 'round, it get scandalous</p>
      <p begin="01:28.282" end="01:30.154" ttm:agent="v1">Break it off from my b***h like PinkPantheress</p>
      <p begin="01:30.154" end="01:32.011" ttm:agent="v1">I know his lil' girlfriend been a fan of this</p>
      <p begin="01:32.011" end="01:33.933" ttm:agent="v1">Bro, keep a stick around, I'm doin' spells, Harry Potter</p>
      <p begin="01:33.933" end="01:35.844" ttm:agent="v1">On God, I got no time to waste</p>
      <p begin="01:35.844" end="01:37.980" ttm:agent="v1">The way I treat hoes makes me not want a daughter</p>
      <p begin="01:37.980" end="01:40.649" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Not my birthday but I done got cake like, yeah (**** you, Shady, hahaha)</p>
      <p begin="01:40.649" end="01:42.149" ttm:agent="v1">Push yo' shit—</p>
      <p begin="01:41.729" end="01:43.878" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Back (Shit back), what a shame, what a waste (B***h)</p>
      <p begin="01:43.878" end="01:45.747" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Two twin Glocks, I ain't talkin' Mary Kate (Ayy, ayy)</p>
      <p begin="01:45.747" end="01:47.645" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Can't **** a dirty thot, she way too basic (Too basic)</p>
      <p begin="01:47.645" end="01:49.519" ttm:agent="v1">Oh, shit, I just made another K</p>
      <p begin="01:49.519" end="01:51.377" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Let's slow it down and now fast (Now fast)</p>
      <p begin="01:51.377" end="01:52.981" ttm:agent="v1">Still braggin’ 'bout the b***h, no racks</p>
      <p begin="01:52.981" end="01:54.838" ttm:agent="v1">10K, my fit, why you all up in my bag?</p>
      <p begin="01:54.838" end="01:57.242" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">And I be getting to the cash, lil' b***h, and that's facts (Ayy, ayy, ayy)</p>
      <p begin="01:57.242" end="01:58.742" ttm:agent="v1">[Outro: 1nonly]</p>
      <p begin="01:57.504" end="01:59.004" ttm:agent="v1">Slow it d-d-d-d, fast</p>
      <p begin="01:58.831" end="02:00.754" ttm:agent="v1">B-b-braggin' 'bout the b***h, no racks</p>
      <p begin="02:00.754" end="02:02.638" ttm:agent="v1">M-m-m-my fit, why y-y-you, in my bag?</p>
      <p begin="02:02.638" end="02:04.798" ttm:agent="v1">And I be getting to the cash, lil-lil-lil baby, and that's facts</p>
      <p begin="02:04.798" end="02:06.402" ttm:agent="v1">Slow it d-d-d-d, fast</p>
      <p begin="02:06.402" end="02:08.810" ttm:agent="v1">B-b-braggin' 'bout the b***h, no racks</p>
      <p begin="02:08.810" end="02:10.429" ttm:agent="v1">M-m-m-my fit, why y-y-you, in my bag?</p>
      <p begin="02:10.429" end="02:14.429" ttm:agent="v1">And I be getting to the cash, lil-lil-lil baby, and that's facts</p>
    </div>
